From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:00:11 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 100/102] ui-egui, app: office overlay hook (name, icon,
 version, attribution)

Adds a build-script/overlay module pair (build_office.rs, office_overlay.rs) that renders
OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR/overlay.env into constants, and routes the app name, window title,
window icon, About version and attribution through it. i18n::tr and trc pass their result
through rebrand(), so every catalog string shows the overlay's name and the upstream
'Part of ...' sentence is dropped. Without OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR every value is upstream's own.
